      "writtenOn": "2022-03-25T17:57:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not sure how this hasn\u0027t come up before, but the initial roles when PD starts are either going to be Source/DFP/VCONN Source or Sink/UFP/VCONN off. Source vs Sink controls the others, so probably, when the TCPM comes up, it\u0027s going to treat the partner as if it were Sink/UFP/VCONN off.\n\nI\u0027m not sure what the implications are for our tests, and this is out of scope for this CL, but these initial roles should be consistent, and something else might need to change because of that.",
